  "explanation": "The question asks when the National Indian Association was formed. Multiple distinct referents appear in the sources:\n\n1. **1900** is cited in D2S8 as the formation date of the *National Indian Association* in the context of nationalist movements.\n2. **1870** appears in D3S6 and D4S6 as the formation date of the *National Indian Association in Aid of Social Progress in India*, formed by Mary Carpenter in Bristol.\n3. **1879** is mentioned in D5S3 as the initial founding year of an *Association* reacting to Oklahoma Indian Territory issues.\n4. **Formed in Bristol by Mary Carpenter** is directly stated in D3S1, D4S6, and D6S2, referring to the 1870 organization.\n\nThese are distinct entities or interpretations of the same name, so they are preserved as separate valid answers."
}
